{'job_title_name': 'Workforce Manager (m/f/x)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'rebuy', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Rebuy-4?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhacstbak5r2800&fromjk=593caebdc8d668c1', 'city': 'Berlin', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 3, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=593caebdc8d668c1&bb=DPY3aYcGeuQbcC5FCHM-r_4AsoJmAhXLjaFMYFe0x8lReopBmN5bY8ZhpVqwVi3j&xkcb=SoDz67M3HqR8wM2YCJ0NbzkdCdPP&fccid=ff7fa90cb7b1e843&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=20', 'job_description': "Ready to become part of the most important mission on this planet? We are rebuy, pioneers in the sustainable reuse of electronics and media. and we are looking for you! Our mission: to make circular living accessible to all, one transaction at a time. By giving products a second chance, we reduce resource consumption and avoid unnecessary e-waste.\nOur team of 600 comes from all corners of the world; we drive things forward collaboratively, take personal responsibility, value positive critical thinking, and persistently serve our customers and planet.\nWe are looking for a workforce manager for our customer service department. Your responsibilities are planning the whole customer support for mail messaging, call, chat and backoffice tasks, as well as vacation and emergency planning over 2 different sites in Germany and Poland. You have to balance out capacities with service levels and availability on a daily basis and overview the whole conversation volumes that are coming in from different channels. You will guide and advise our controlling teams with a deep understanding of the workforce needed for further sharpening our customer service team to become a true customer excellence service.\nKey Responsibilities:\nDetermining staffing requirements on the basis of historical data and the forecast\nCreating shift plans to cover the predicted demand\nEmergency shift planning\nPermanent increase in effectiveness through improvements to shift plans & forecasts\nData maintenance in the shift planning tool\nDefinition and optimisation of a sickness and holiday process\nReal-time control of incoming contacts across all channels (call, email, social media, portals, etc.) for various locations\nComparison of forecast planning with actual status and identification of factors that have influenced the forecast\nQualifications:\nAnalytical thinking\nVery good MS Office skills\nPrecise and careful work\nDistinct understanding of service\nAbstract way of thinking and a spirit of innovating\nStress resistance, ability to work under pressure\nOrganisational talent\nWillingness to learn\nAbility to work independently\nFluent in English and basic knowledge in German\nLocation:\nBerlin\nHome Office\nHybrid - can work remotely in Germany\nPurpose, a great company culture and incredible benefits - what to expect at rebuy:\nWork with a friendly team that is passionate about circularity and wants to make the world a little more sustainable, one transaction at a time.\nFeel comfortable in an environment where independence and new ideas are welcome.\nBenefit from flat hierarchies and the greatest possible transparency so that things don't take longer than they have to and you always feel well informed.\nEnjoy our centrally located office in Berlin (Erkelenzdamm 11 - 13, 10999 Berlin).\nBenefit from our family-friendly, flexible environment and paid child sick leave.\nBring your dog to the office: we love animals and want to cuddle yours, too!\nUse employee discounts on rebuy.de, sustainable products at Futurebens, offers for sustainable micro-mobility and massages directly in our office.\nDesign your own benefits mix on our benefits portal worth EUR 50 net per month.\nHave fun at our legendary team and company events.\nUse our mental health offers as part of a cooperation with the Fürstenberg Institute.\nTake care of your work-life balance with 30 vacation days.\nAt rebuy all people are welcome and supported! We would like to talk, regardless of age, disability, national and social origin, skin color, religion, gender identity and sexual orientation. Just be who you are!", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 37, 45, 178194), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
