{'job_title_name': 'Teamlead Customer Service / Teamleiter Kundenservice (m/w/d)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'rebuy', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Rebuy-4?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhacte9g2gra000&fromjk=0cc94ed4a4712635', 'city': 'Berlin', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 3, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=0cc94ed4a4712635&bb=DPY3aYcGeuSc_7WjLc1TefSRzsX8WxVzWa3HJVZvo3J7g9zyv-wJRgzNAAl5kS7W&xkcb=SoDa67M3HqR8wM2YCJ0PbzkdCdPP&fccid=ff7fa90cb7b1e843&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=20', 'job_description': "Ready to become part of the most important mission on this planet? We are rebuy, pioneers in the sustainable reuse of electronics and media and we are looking for you! Our mission: to make circular living accessible to all, one transaction at a time. By giving products a second chance, we reduce resource consumption and avoid unnecessary e-waste.\nOur team of 600 comes from all corners of the world; we drive things forward collaboratively, take personal responsibility, value positive critical thinking, and persistently serve our customers and planet.\nAs a team leader in customer service at rebuy, you are the professional and disciplinary manager for +10 employees and are responsible for day-to-day operations. You develop and promote your subordinates and monitor our key figures on a daily basis. You act as a role model and contact person for employees, partners and internal departments. You are also characterised by strong leadership qualities and are able to motivate your team even in more difficult phases.\nYour tasks include\nProfessional and disciplinary personnel management of a customer service team of +10 employees\nProfessional and disciplinary management of senior agents\nPromoting team building and creating conditions for high employee satisfaction and motivation\nCreating development plans based on the employee score card\nActively living our corporate values in accordance with management guidelines\nAchieving qualitative and quantitative team targets for Berlin in cooperation with Poznan\nPersonnel development through regular feedback\nParticipation in the continuous improvement of processes and structures, focussing on the needs of our customers\nSupport and backup for day-to-day management\nSupport with quality measurement and evaluation\nCarrying out coaching sessions for employees on operational topics\nSuccessfully completed vocational training and several years of experience in disciplinary personnel management, ideally in customer service\nSound knowledge of day-to-day management and understanding of key metrics in the area of customer service\nStrong analytical skills to quickly recognise and proactively respond to disruptive factors and trends\nStrong communication and teamwork skills as well as good interpersonal skills\nAssertiveness, self-confident demeanour and clear goal orientation\nGood to very good knowledge of English\nWillingness to work in shifts and on Saturdays\nSolid PC user skills\nLoyalty, honesty, high service and customer orientation as well as a positive attitude are further important characteristics that round off your profile\nLocation:\nBerlin\nHome office\nHybrid possible\nPurpose, a great company culture and awesome benefits - what to expect at rebuy:\nWork with a friendly team that is passionate about circularity and wants to make the world a little more sustainable, one transaction at a time.\nFeel comfortable in an environment where independence and new ideas are welcome.\nBenefit from flat hierarchies and the greatest possible transparency so that things don't take longer than they have to and you always feel well informed.\nEnjoy our centrally located office in Berlin (Erkelenzdamm 11 - 13, 10999 Berlin).\nBenefit from our family-friendly, flexible environment and paid child sick leave.\nBring your dog to the office: we love animals and want to cuddle yours, too!\nUse employee discounts on rebuy.de, sustainable products at Futurebens, offers for sustainable micro-mobility and massages directly in our office.\nDesign your own benefits mix on our benefits portal worth EUR 50 net per month.\nHave fun at our legendary team and company events.\nUse our mental health offers as part of a cooperation with the Fürstenberg Institute.\nTake care of your work-life balance with 30 vacation days.\nAt reBuy all people are welcome and supported! We would like to talk, regardless of age, disability, national and social origin, skin color, religion, gender identity and sexual orientation. Just be who you are!", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 38, 2, 310415), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
