{'job_title_name': 'Data Analyst (m/f/x)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'rebuy', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Rebuy-4?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhacteuv2cj4000&fromjk=ecc5a8db3e150523', 'city': 'Berlin', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 3, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=ecc5a8db3e150523&bb=XqF14vW7C8VSwWwOy8Y9xoZTbU0f7ssO0h5Ogs0Ub96VxXyqfDpBfTVa9_QOUKtC&xkcb=SoA467M3HqR8wMWYCJ0KbzkdCdPP&fccid=ff7fa90cb7b1e843&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=20', 'job_description': "Ready to become part of the most important mission on this planet? We are rebuy, pioneers in the sustainable reuse of electronics and media. and we are looking for you! Our mission: to make circular living accessible to all, one transaction at a time. By giving products a second chance, we reduce resource consumption and avoid unnecessary e-waste.\nOur team of 600 comes from all corners of the world; we drive things forward collaboratively, take personal responsibility, value positive critical thinking, and persistently serve our customers and planet.\nWe are looking for a\nData Analyst - Commercial\nin the central BI & Analytics team, currently consisting of multiple Data Analysts and Data Engineers.\nAt rebuy, we strongly believe in the power of cooperation. This is why this position is a cross-functional role: You will have the power of the BI team behind your back while your stakeholders and colleagues will be the Controlling and Commercial teams. You will be part of all of those teams, bringing your data skills into departments where this knowledge is not natively found.\nThis role is not just about doing analysis to answer questions raised by stakeholders. We are looking for someone who understands the needs and struggles of our commercial departments and who can solve their problems using the power of data. Someone who makes sure that data is the loudest voice in a room full of personal opinions. You’ll apply critical thinking, objectivity, and pragmatic data-wrangling skills to enable evidence-based decisions and create reliable data flows.\nKey Responsibilities:\nPartner with the commercial and controlling teams to identify potential improvements in business processes.\nProactively analyze data to answer key questions from stakeholders, come up with actionable insights, and present them in a concise presentation or a dashboard\nQuestion how we steer towards our revenue and profitability goals, how we currently achieve them and how to improve that process.\nAnalyze data from the company databases to drive improvement of commercial processes and business strategies\nTake full ownership of projects and be proactive in leading initiatives\nWhat you'll receive in return:\nAutonomy\nVisibility to present your work\nSupport from a central Data team and coaching from a central functional lead\nExposure to real challenges with a big impact\nChance to work with a purpose-driven business, helping the planet\nMore than 2 years of experience in analytics, data science, or similar fields\nExperience in working in a commercial steering environment is a plus\nProven analytical skills, including cleaning, evaluation, analysis, and visualization of data\nAgile mindset and strong problem-solving skills with an emphasis on finding the right approach for a given challenge\nProficiency in SQL and experience working with large data sets\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills in English\nExperience in creating dashboards (we use Looker)\nLocation:\nBerlin\nHO\nRemote within Germany\nPurpose, a great company culture and incredible benefits - what to expect at rebuy:\nWork with a friendly team that is passionate about circularity and wants to make the world a little more sustainable, one transaction at a time.\nFeel comfortable in an environment where independence and new ideas are welcome.\nBenefit from flat hierarchies and the greatest possible transparency so that things don't take longer than they have to and you always feel well informed.\nEnjoy our centrally located office in Berlin (Erkelenzdamm 11 - 13, 10999 Berlin).\nBenefit from our family-friendly, flexible environment and paid child sick leave.\nBring your dog to the office: we love animals and want to cuddle yours, too!\nUse employee discounts on rebuy.de, sustainable products at Futurebens, offers for sustainable micro-mobility and massages directly in our office.\nDesign your own benefits mix on our benefits portal worth EUR 50 net per month.\nHave fun at our legendary team and company events.\nUse our mental health offers as part of a cooperation with the Fürstenberg Institute.\nTake care of your work-life balance with 30 vacation days.\nAt rebuy all people are welcome and supported! We would like to talk, regardless of age, disability, national and social origin, skin color, religion, gender identity and sexual orientation. Just be who you are!", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 38, 3, 20619), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
