{'job_title_name': 'Product Sustainability Manager (f/m/d)', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'instagrid', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Instagrid?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhactpvkjkuq800&fromjk=e6c3cbcd82004f79', 'city': None, 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 4, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=e6c3cbcd82004f79&bb=mBuLyZdkzXh-If6KUcfTaDI9uWQOu5vDRDXIIQHuh7A0xYpOL74SPAO7haSsf3nk&xkcb=SoD767M3HqR-JmAMiL0KbzkdCdPP&fccid=e3d9441660df1bb7&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=30', 'job_description': 'Job Description\nAs a Product Sustainability Manager (f/m/d), you will assess the environmental impact of our products throughout their entire life cycle. With your expertise, you will also support our product development team in the realization of innovative and resource-saving solutions that increase product circularity. You will work with suppliers to collect environmental data, analyse it and derive recommended actions. You contribute to instagrids CO2 reduction goals verified by SBTi and lead their implementation.\nYou are conducting Lifecycle Assessments for our products\nYou are responsible for assessing our product circularity according to recognized standards\nYou derive requirements for the product development process in collaboration with Product Owners and Engineering Team\nYou lead the implementation of a Sustainable Product Development Roadmap as cross-functional project\nYou monitor relevant policies, standards and regulations in regard to circularity\nYou lead the implementation of our instagrid net zero roadmap with the focus on scope 3 emissions\nRequirements\nYou have 5+ years of experience in project management and a comprehensive expertise in conducting lifecycle assessments\nYou have experience in working across interdisciplinary teams with a technical background\nYou have expertise in sustainable product development and different approaches to assess and increase product circularity\nYou are self organized, driven and enjoy tackling complex topics\nYou have the ability to break down complex topics for different stakeholders and work on an eye-level\nYou speak English on a professional level', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 38, 14, 700805), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
