{'job_title_name': 'Stack Architect (f/m/x)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Leasing for Good / UNOWN', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Leasing-For-Good-Unown?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhacvdacjkvk800&fromjk=5815c6a3c4678422', 'city': '20095 Hamburg', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 29, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=5815c6a3c4678422&bb=A0eU7t4AoX1G7dqiH739o-i62C6dCSwb10FRTylkFBzOtU2p15lnLc2NWLKS3-Ky&xkcb=SoBc67M3HqRyuigDBD0CbzkdCdPP&fccid=76b56a85963dc25e&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=280', 'job_description': "UNOWN is a pioneer of the circular economy. For end-consumers we offer a subscription service that makes sustainability the more convenient option. For our business partners we build software that enables them to have a share of the leasing market.\nWe believe the future of consumption is fully circular, and we do our bit to make it happen.\nSustainable action needs to be quantifiable in order to be effective. This is why we are constantly working on new methods to measure and reduce our ecological footprintacross all business areas. This is how we combine economic success with sustainable action.\nWe are a start-up that is dedicated to changing the fashion industry one lease at a time. We want to grow our business quickly and in a healthy way. We are investor-backed.\nKey facts about the job\nPart- or full-time (let’s talk about what would work for you and us\nLocation: Hamburg or remote within Germany\nStart: as soon as possible\nTasks\nWe are a young start-up with plenty of jobs that need to be done. There’s always something to improve or to develop, and every one of us is motivated to get the job done. As a developer your main responsibilities include:\nDevelop high-quality, test-driven software and mobile applications\nDefine strategic direction of future tech roadmap\nWork in close collaboration with our UX/UI team to improve user experience\nProfessional leadership and management of junior developers\nRequirements\nYou have 5+ years of experience and you've shipped multiple large software projects\nYou have at least 2 years hands-on experience in full-stack development\nYou have recent experience with Angular and web API\nYou have practical and recent experience with Nodejs, Express, REST-API\nYou worked with SQL based databases\nYou have fun solving business and technical problems\nIt’s a plus if you have mobile dev experience\nYour world is the development of human-centric digital products, you work in sync with frontend and UX\nYou’re a driven and proactive doer and you find solutions, not problems\nYou have experience in mentoring junior developers\nYou’re fluent in Englis\nBenefits\nA flexible and people-centric startup life\nResponsibility and creative freedom to shape a company in its early stage\nFast decision-making processes and varied tasks\nWork in a purpose-driven people who know exactly why they come to work\nLearning and networking events in the startup world\nDiscounts on our portfolio\nFlexible working hours\nInterested? Awesome! We are looking forward to hearing from you!", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 39, 6, 899473), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
