{'job_title_name': 'Mobile Developer at UNOWN (f/m/x)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Leasing for Good / UNOWN', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Leasing-For-Good-Unown?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad0d5tjqun800&fromjk=48256b9b08981046', 'city': '20095 Hamburg', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 22, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=48256b9b08981046&bb=6uO9H_gxWCCDjglmk86OBIVDyRXLnUakCTvLaNoxHStErT22pI78ghn3YhvXMguj&xkcb=SoD467M3HqSOlN2eC50CbzkdCdPP&fccid=76b56a85963dc25e&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=210', 'job_description': "Who are we\nUNOWN is a pioneer in circular fashion. For end consumers we offer a subscription service that makes sustainability the more convenient option. For our business partners we build a software enabling them to have a share of the leasing market.\nWe believe that sustainable action needs to be quantifiable in order to be effective. This is why we are constantly working on new methods to measure and reduce our ecological footprint\nacross all business areas. In this way we combine economic interests with sustainable action.\nWe are a startup that is dedicated to changing the fashion industry one lease at a time. We want to grow our business quickly and in a healthy way. We are investor-backed.\nKey facts about the job\nPart- or full-time (let’s talk about what would work for you and us\nLocation: Hamburg or remote within Germany\nStart: as soon as possible\nTasks\nYour activities\nWe are a young start-up with plenty of jobs that need to be done. There’s always something to improve or to develop, and every one of us is motivated to get the job done. As developer your main responsibilities include:\nDevelop high-quality, test-driven software and mobile applications\nDefine strategic direction of future tech roadmap\nWork in close collaboration with our UX/UI team to improve user experience\nProfessional leadership and management of junior developers\nRequirements\nYour profile\nYou have 3+ years of experience and you've shipped multiple large software projects\nYou gained extensive with app and web development and had first experience coding in Dart (or related technologies e.g. Typescript, C#, Swift and/or Objective C)\nYou have experience working in the AWS ecosystem\nYour world is the development of human-centric digital products, you work in sync with Frontend and UX\nYou know your way around web and data security and know how to address potential weak spots\nYou’re a driven and proactive doer and you find solutions, not problems\nYou have a (strong) interest in the impact economy and sustainability\nYou’re fluent in English\nIt’s a plus if you’ve worked in the startup environment\nBenefits\nYour benefits\nA flexible and people-centric startup life\nResponsibility and creative freedom to shape a product in its early stage\nFast decision-making processes and varied tasks\nWork with purpose-driven founders\nLearning and networking events in the startup world\nDiscounts on our portfolio\nFlexible working hours\nInterested? Awesome!\nWe are looking forward to hearing from you!", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 39, 39, 643781), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
