{'job_title_name': 'Team Assistant* Business Development', 'job_type': 'Festanstellung', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Tomra', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Tomra?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad0h8ij30g801&fromjk=95f28e3201dc7c70', 'city': ' 56218 Mülheim-Kärlich', 'remote': 'Zum Teil im Homeoffice', 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 22, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=95f28e3201dc7c70&bb=E1Fx1Wgi2t1ltdtMU2ZLWOmYspdVMOioaBh7IQAI9mmvJFR3Py5ZU2hfWuQoZViH&xkcb=SoAR67M3HqSOlCWeC50PbzkdCdPP&fccid=94844d1fef46eb96&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=210', 'job_description': 'Company Description\nFULL TIME\nhybride-remote (2 times in the office)\nGermany, Mülheim-Kärlich\nToday, we are not utilizing resources in a sustainable way. In fact, the world is only 9% circular, meaning much of the Earth’s precious resources are only used once, leaving huge untapped potential for more sustainable resource management.\nTOMRA\nprovides cutting-edge sorting solutions for optimal resource productivity within the recycling, mining and food industries and is therefore uniquely positioned to shape the Circular Economy, creating demand for this way of thinking in the world. At TOMRA we want to be a thought leader, encouraging a more sustainable way of thinking and inspiring active change around the world.\nWith our deep application knowledge, powerful machine learning software and a variety of in-house developed sensors we offer our customers state-of-the-art, high-performance sorting solutions for maximum purity and yield.\nJob Description\nIf you are a well-organized person who enjoys supporting a dedicated team in varied tasks, we are looking for YOU as our new Business Development\nTeam Assistant (m/f/d)\n.\nResponsibilities of the role are:\nSupporting the (Management) Team in day-to-day tasks like scheduling of meetings and business trips (travel management)\nHandling incoming and outgoing (e-)mail\nCommunicating interculturally with in- and external stakeholders, also conducting IDD checks\nCoordinating team events and activities (virtually and on site)\nMaintaining and administering files\nSupporting in Business reports & analysis\nQualifications\n3-5 years of working experience in a similar role as assistant (for management, a team or project), preferably in an international environment\nConfident command of usage of MS Office 365 Suite, also being familiar with working collaboratively in a cloud environment\nEducational background\nAn office related vocational education (IHK apprenticeship or equivalent) or relevant training on the job\nOther skills / abilities\nWell-structured, being able to prioritize while keeping an overview in a dynamic environment\nThinking along and completing assigned tasks independently\nSolution-oriented team player with intercultural competence\nStrong communication skills adapting per target group\nbeing fluent in English and German, other languages being a plus\nAdditional Information\n30 days annual leave;\nSupported group accident insurance;\nHybrid working principles, flexible working hours;\nOpportunity to purchase TOMRA shares;\nEmployee benefit discounts for TOMRA Online Shop;\nCompany (e-) bike leasing;\nGym membership coverage support;\nOffice comfort: free parking spaces, canteen, coffee machines;\nCoaching opportunities - Individual Development Programs;\nNorwegian corporate culture (\nno hierarchical thinking, transparent communication culture\n).', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 39, 43, 682280), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
