{'job_title_name': 'Customer Project Manager* - Mining', 'job_type': 'Festanstellung', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Tomra', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Tomra?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad0lmgipbk800&fromjk=54c5bac81069d6b6', 'city': '22880 Wedel', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 23, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=54c5bac81069d6b6&bb=XH0U6oFDuuT8qpFA_ZaSA6ahg1gBv-14w6zfUTV60KnorVrdgtxmVDM_xSsgUaUq&xkcb=SoBF67M3HqSO5s2Q5B0IbzkdCdPP&fccid=94844d1fef46eb96&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=220', 'job_description': 'Company Description\nWhy TOMRA?\nTOMRA is a world leader in optical and electronic sorting equipment. TOMRA Sorting is a dynamic company with an outstanding product line and an excellent level of customer satisfaction.\nWhy is it worthwhile to start and stay at TOMRA? Quite simply, we are a steadily growing international company that has retained its family atmosphere. Our corporate culture is Norwegian, which means there is no hierarchical thinking. We see a bright future in economic terms. Aside from that, it´s nice to know that our mining ore sorting machines are helping to source the necessary minerals in an environmental friendlier way.\nAt TOMRA, we place significant emphasis on maximizing resource value and utilization, which contributes to the concept of the circular economy: an economic system designed to keep products, components and materials at their highest value throughout their life cycles within a closed loop.\nTechnology plays a crucial role in achieving this, with advances in certain fields helping to bring about new approaches that can help maximize the value of resources and – crucially – reduce waste.\nOUR ROLE\nTOMRA Mining designs and manufactures sensor-based sorting technologies for the global mineral processing and mining industries.\nAs the world market leader in sensor-based ore sorting, TOMRA is responsible for developing and engineering cutting-edge technology made to withstand harsh mining environments. TOMRA maintains its rigorous focus on quality and future-oriented thinking with technology tailor-made for mining.\nTOMRA’s sensor-based solutions play a key role in optimizing resource productivity.\nThe result is a greater understanding of where efficiencies can be made to minimize costs and waste, and better utilize resources within a closed loop – further mitigating the impact of CO2 and other emissions and inefficiencies.\nJob Description\nRole and Responsibilities\nYour responsibilities will include:\nManaging of projects in the Mining business stream according to applicable procedures (check of input from sales, check of contract details (review), internal project coordination (PSR) by using relevant software, ERP system (IFS) etc., interface clearance with internal and external customers, achievement of customer acceptance, monitor including payments\nDistribute project closed report and post calculation of costs\nBuild up and maintain reliable relations with our customers to solve problems\nTechnical consulting work for customer and sales in case of complex plant design\nSupport sales team\nResponsible for successful project execution including project costs and timing to the satisfaction of our customers\nProcess of continuous improvements within area of responsibility\nQualifications\nWe are looking for someone with the following profile:\nGood communication skills both verbally as in writing\nExcellent level of coordination and organization skills\nVery good problem-solving skills\nTechnical expertise to gain good knowledge of our Mining technology\nBeing self-motivated and having the proven capacity to fully complete tasks\nWillingness to travel abroad\nFluent in English and German (verbal and in writing)\nAdditional Information\nAre you interested?\nPlease apply clicking the "I\'m Interested" button.\nPlease send us your CV and motivation letter in English.\nWe are looking forward to reviewing your application!\nTOMRA Website: https://www.tomra.com\nPlease note: this position is an office based position with some travel to visit our customer\'s mine sites.\nTomra does not discriminate based on gender, race or ethnicity, religion, skin color, sexual orientation or identity, disability, age, and other protected status characteristics according to applicable law. We are committed to a diverse and inclusive environment and take pride in being an equal opportunity employer.\nMost importantly, it fits!\n#LI-MH1', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 39, 48, 161571), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
