{'job_title_name': 'Want to grow OPM/SMM in a Startup? Looking for a Marketing Manager [m/f/d]', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'equipme GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Equipme-Gmbh?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad0tonk6ot800&fromjk=69806540068587bd', 'city': '65843 Sulzbach', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 25, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=69806540068587bd&bb=cvep825DAk8QClou_p4brewmq7bxRVZJu-Pf5MhJYH0GM5LFilCqXC9P6TbZUHiV_gf0kj9Cyo2CMUVgSn-4yZTUmgrwiOOo4CPtPao9Rjs%3D&xkcb=SoDr67M3HqSO622Q8p0KbzkdCdPP&fccid=f7353fcad5d507b0&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=240', 'job_description': 'Our offer\nWant to be part of our growth story?\nWe\'re looking for you to build our organic social media marketing and successfully kick-start it with online performance marketing.\nIn our B2B SaaS startup, we offer you the opportunity to contribute your skills directly and to develop personally and professionally in exciting challenges. You are guaranteed not to get bored on our mission, rather you can grow beyond your limits, because your task is essential for our success.\nIn return, we offer you the opportunity to invest your working time in tasks whose results you can see immediately and produce a real imparct.\nTogether with you, we are building a world-class team that will not just follows our path, the team will shape it!\nYou take responsibility for campaigns, ads, social media, mailings and much more. around the topics B2B Subscription, Circular Economy, digital business processes and Everything as a Service (XaaS). As part of the marketing team, you will work closely with colleagues from product development, sales and the onboarding team. Team performance is our top priority.\nIn facts\nPure startup: dynamic, uncomplicated, exciting opportunities.\nPermanent position (full-time) in a fast-growing company\nFlat hierarchies and extensive development opportunities\nSelf-determined and independent work\nFlexible working hours - work-life balance with focus on your work-works ;-)\nHybrid Work!\nFocused work in the home office\nCollaborative work in the office\nEnriching offside events to synchronize\nExciting tasks in a growing market\nOpen, modern corporate culture\nWe are looking for you\nYou have privately more Netflix, HelloFresh or car sharing subscriptions than you can manage\nYou believe that companies can also make their everyday life easier with subscriptions\nYou love online marketing and want a lot more of it!\nYou have experience in B2B and know what concerns decision makers\nYou\'d rather look for solutions than excuses\nYou are a doer and bring strategy to the streets\nYou\'re in the mood for exponential growth\nYou are a team player and pull together with all other areas such as Sales, Dev, CSM, Support etc.\nYour area of responsibility\nOnline Performance Marketing\nYou implement SEA (Search Engine Advertising) and SMA (Social Media Advertising) with appropriate tools and KPIs.\nYou build and optimize landing pages to a high content and visual standard.\nYou develop content for whitepapers, landing pages, and ads.\nYou make customers aware of their problems and demonstrate how these wouldn\'t even arise with Equipme.\nYou generate a plethora of MQLs (Marketing Qualified Leads) and hand them over to sales.\nYou proactively track campaign performance and costs and regularly report on performance and insights to the team.\nSocial Media Marketing\nYou develop Equipme into a brand and thought leader.\nYou write social media articles and publish them independently on a regular basis.\nYou regularly report on interesting events, success stories, and user stories.\nYou work on continuously increasing the reach on social media.\nYou manage the social media accounts, measure the effectiveness of actions, and proactively suggest improvements.\nYour profile\nYou love online marketing and want a lot more of it!\nYou have experience in B2B and know what concerns decision makers\nYou have successfully completed a degree in marketing, media or communication or something similar\nYou are a doer and bring strategy to the streets\nYou speak fluent German and good English\nYou write perfectly in Englisch and German\nAbout us\nWe are a young startup, with many of us already over 30: Old enough to have experienced how the "old economy" works and young enough to know that the next generation works and consumes differently. We ourselves belong to the generation that prefers to use rather than own. In return, we know the value of self-determined work and the magic of a shared mission.\nOur software is designed to take all of these insights and experiences into account and help companies around the world connect digitally with their suppliers and consume their offerings flexibly "as a service."\nBecause just as we have been simplifying our private lives for years by using "Uber" services and "Netflix" subscriptions, more and more companies are striving to consume flexible services instead of owning products. "Everything as a Service" is the next big trend in the business-to-business segment and we are building the operating system for it. For the good of our collective economic future and the protection of valuable resources.\nWe are equipme and look forward to meeting you!', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 39, 56, 546282), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
