{'job_title_name': 'Assistant Sales Manager (m/f/d)', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Career Management GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Career-Management-Gmbh?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad1akcjkvk800&fromjk=516139b61383d511', 'city': 'Berlin', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 16, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=516139b61383d511&bb=LI09SRAlA39Dye4aihclmMBp0trQxWmBYG6DHZZg3ZcxzG7MgW35WSDRc2luNJA7&xkcb=SoDK67M3HqSLX62YCJ0IbzkdCdPP&fccid=3870cae317db0e56&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=150', 'job_description': "Berlin\n01.02.2024\nVollzeit\nJob-ID: CT23-1852\n////\nOur client is a “Mobility-Tech-Start Up”, backed by a listed industry group with a global footprint and currently in stealth mode. The company - headquartered at Berlin- is aiming to realize a market entrance into the emerging European eBike market and to build up an ecosystem. High tech products, sustainability and circular economy will be the pillars of the new company.\nAs an Assistant Sales Manager with more than 5 years of experience in the bicycle industry, you will be responsible for developing the sales channels, developing sales strategies, and B to B sales. You will play a pivotal role in building and maintaining customer relationships and driving the company's sales objectives.\nBenefits\nPermanent employment contract\nFull-time employment\nInternational team with many opportunities to use your language skills\nDynamic and international working environment\nWide range of tasks\nVery Attractive office near Warschauer Straße station\nOther benefit can be added (TBD)\nIhre Aufgaben\nDevelop and implement comprehensive sales strategies and business plans to achieve revenue and market share growth.\nIdentify new market opportunities, trends, and potential growth areas within the bicycle industry.\nDevelop sales channels for especially BtoB sales.\nBuild and maintain strong relationships with key customers, dealers, and distributors\nProvide senior-level support for major accounts, including negotiations and resolving complex issues.\nCollaborate with the marketing team to realize the lead to sales.\nSet and monitor sales targets\nSupport the team consistently meets or exceeds monthly and annual sales goals.\nIdentify areas for improvement and implement strategies to optimize sales performance.\nStay updated on the latest bicycle products, industry trends, and competitors.\nSupport the team to communicate the unique features and benefits of the company's products.\nIhre Qualifikationen\nBachelor's degree in business, marketing, or a related field.\nFluent in German and English.\nA minimum of 5 years of progressive experience in sales, with a strong focus on the bicycle industry.\nProgressive experience in B to B sales, in bicycle industry.\nProven track record of achieving and exceeding sales targets and leading successful sales teams.\nExceptional leadership and team management skills.\nExcellent communication, negotiation, and interpersonal abilities.\nIn-depth knowledge of bicycle products, components, and market dynamics.\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills.\nProficiency in CRM and sales management software.\nWe look forward to hearing from you!\nYour Career Management Team\nIhr Ansprechpartner\nCareer Management GmbH\nImmermannstr. 7\n40210 Düsseldorf\nduesseldorf@career-management.de", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 40, 9, 751960), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
