{'job_title_name': '(Junior) Key Account Manager France and Spain - Circular Economy (m/f/d)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Tonitrus GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Tonitrus-Gmbh?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad217kjkvk800&fromjk=66e81e1617150ce9', 'city': '10117 Berlin', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 20, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=66e81e1617150ce9&bb=J5CiV8WXoRl5Ffz-I63yamFTPry6J63EJWq1UwMaOsbsf7k1EgZm0RgsN_i08tT9&xkcb=SoBZ67M3HqSLuOxTsp0PbzkdCdPP&fccid=86b380487a4cc812&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=190', 'job_description': 'Your mission\nUnderstanding customer growth from the existing account base through cross-selling and upselling\nIncreasing customer retention and growth in line with individual KPI’s\nManaging constantly incoming new B2B customer streams\nIdentifying customers demand and preparing quotations\nEmbracing the powerful features of our CRM system\nIndependent working manner and account management with room for self-organisation\nYour profile\nAny Bachelor and/or Master degree or equivalent work experience\nStrong communication skills\nCustomer-centric thinking\nEnthusiasm for sales and the circular economy/ circular IT\nFluent language skills for at least one of the above mentioned countries and good English skills for our internal communication\nWhy us?\nGreat team spirit within our comany and our multi-national Berlin sales team including regular company events throughout the year\nExciting customer projects in the Circular Economy\nStructured onboarding process and ongoing trainings by experienced sales managers\nLots of room for personal and professional development\nModern workspace with latest technology and equipment\nPerformance-oriented salaray scheme and further sales incentives\nOffice location (Friedrichstraße 68, Berlin) in a modern & spacious office building with lots of amenities such as a café and a rooftop terrace\nAbout us\nTonitrus is an international IT company engaged in the Circular Economy. Our focus lies on offering products in the area of Servers, Storage, Networking and Computing. We help companies and public institutions across Europe and worldwide by not only delivering first class IT hardware to them, but also by helping our customers to reduce their carbon footprint & to save their IT budget at the same time by supplying refurbished „as good as new“ IT products. We round up our offerings by also providing various IT services such as Third-Party-Maintenance & Certified Data Erasure. We keep available over 50,000 SKUs to our valued customers in more than 20 countries across Europe with same-day-shipment options via marketplaces and via our multi-language webshops (tonitrus.com), supported by our account managers via Chat, Mail and Phone.\nFor our international sales office in Berlin (Friedrichstraße 68), we are hiring new Sales Managers for our\nFrench and for our Spanish\nsales teams', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 40, 32, 894625), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
