{'job_title_name': 'Email and Marketing Contentwriter - Freelance (m/f/x)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'rebuy', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Rebuy-4?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad21as2gra003&fromjk=628246110a40e373', 'city': None, 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 20, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=628246110a40e373&bb=CgQ8yxyPkjjrwl4oBd7bpYBP_vNtHgIoogZFRbkEMAH43AvjeE4-ibPNoY89oFH3&xkcb=SoCD67M3HqSLuIRTsp0KbzkdCdPP&fccid=ff7fa90cb7b1e843&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=190', 'job_description': "Ready to become part of the most important mission on this planet? We are rebuy, pioneers in the sustainable reuse of electronics and media and we are looking for you! Our mission: to make circular living accessible to all, one transaction at a time. By giving products a second chance, we reduce resource consumption and avoid unnecessary e-waste.\nOur team of 600 comes from all corners of the world; we drive things forward collaboratively, take personal responsibility, value positive critical thinking, and persistently serve our customers and planet.\nWe're searching for a dynamic email and marketing content writer (\nContractor\n) to support our team of Marketing Guru's!\nWhat you will do\nWrite and edit compelling copy for email, banner and push notification campaigns, working closely together with our Campaign Manager\nCraft messaging specific to different customer segments and customer lifecycle stages\nCollaborate closely with the Brand and Content teams to understand and deliver the voice of our brand\nCollaborate closely with out Creative team to execute comprehensive and aligned campaigns together\nResearch topics around our company and industry trends to execute on different content strategies\nConduct A/B tests on copy and monitor Marketing KPIs to improve campaign performance and build-up a learnings repository\nWhat you bring to the table\nProven experience as an Email Marketing Copywriter or Specialist\nAbility to work independently, manage multiple tasks simultaneously and deliver reliably in time\nStrong organisational and communication skills\nKeen in understanding our brand and customers more and becoming an expert on the Circular Economy\nExperience in agile environments or with ticket systems is a plus\nBeing familiar with A/B testing or data-driven copywriting is a plus\nExperience in e-commerce, a sustainable company to the media or Consumer Electronics sector is a plus\nExperience with push notifications, banners or Landing Pages is a plus\nGerman fluency/mother tongue", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 40, 33, 24678), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
