{'job_title_name': 'Sales Development Representative (m/f/d)', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Concular', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Concular?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad29fo2cj4001&fromjk=38ebeb473a6d1d78', 'city': ' 10407 Berlin', 'remote': 'Zum Teil im Homeoffice', 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 21, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=38ebeb473a6d1d78&bb=CJiPVUdvWGtAXf2h2UZEAxh8YTS1B8kl6W-k1KvunYYy_t8xavd7uPsnUA9j2DQirA7XB20loSEo1TRFb8a4SStU4BVEKgj96bJ78eRTgMw%3D&xkcb=SoBM67M3HqSLi7Q3lR0JbzkdCdPP&fccid=51679181ca3c6414&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=200', 'job_description': 'Do you want to radically change the construction industry? Then become part of Concular - an innovative and digital impact startup!\nAbout Us\nWe are a Berlin-based GreenTech startup focused on the circular economy in the construction sector. With our help, building materials in existing buildings are digitized and then reused for use in new buildings, thereby returning them to the material cycle. This saves millions of tons of Co2, resources and waste.\nTasks\nActively build product, customer, and market knowledge\nEducate prospective customers on new and existing capabilities of the software platform\nAs part of the sales team you work with Sales Executives (SE) to research and prioritize target accounts lists in the real estate sector\nValidate and update sales and marketing information in HubSpot\nQualify Inbound leads generated by marketing activities to identify relevant Sales Accepted Opportunities for SEs\nPerform outbound sales activities (prospecting) such as cold calling to locate and qualify relevant Sales Accepted Opportunities for SEs\nNurture potential long-term Opportunities through consistent phone and email communications\nResponsible for building a strong, and consistent pipeline of customer leads\nReport on any new market trends that may provide additional insight to sales and marketing to build out messaging for targeted audiences\nCreate Sales and Marketing materials that support lead generation and nurturing activities\nOther responsibilities are assigned as required\nThe role reports to the responsible Business Development Manager and coaching by the Business Development Team Lead and Head of Sales\nRequirements\nQualifications in the Real Estate Industry\nBackground in architecture and green/ sustainable buildings or construction\nIdeally 1-2 years work experience\nKnowledge of the real estate sector is welcome. Target groups: Asset Managers, Developers, Large Architectural Offices\nStrong time management and organisational skills\nAbility to navigate corporate structures and identify decision-makers\nBenefits\nAccess to many attractive benefits via the Concular Benefits Platform\nA position with a lot of autonomy, ownership and real impact!\nA steep learning curve, exciting challenges and responsibility\nA constantly growing, ambitious and international team in a collegial, fun and professional startup culture\nThe opportunity to get involved and actively shape the transformation of the construction sector\nAn office in the coworking space by Impact Hub Berlin at CRCLR House\nFlexible working hours with home office option\nHave we caught your attention? Send us your application!', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 40, 41, 278340), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
