{'job_title_name': 'ERP System Consultant – FI (d/m/w)', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'ALSO Holding', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Also-Holding?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad35at2gra002&fromjk=433f894ddcfffdad', 'city': 'Soest', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 13, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=433f894ddcfffdad&bb=bE1xlwgQRWXH5wBxOUmxJV5Nefls5GQFElq_uF1cLAJtloVD7eSgmLZUqb0KumEc&xkcb=SoAv67M3HqSG4rA0D70LbzkdCdPP&fccid=9042611748a56601&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=120', 'job_description': "Soest\nALSO is one of the leading technology providers for the ICT industry, currently operating in 30 countries in Europe.\nWe are also in a total of 144 countries worldwide through our PaaS partners. The ALSO ecosystem offers hardware, software and IT services from more than 700 vendors in over 1500 product categories to approximately 120 000 resellers. In the spirit of the circular economy, the company provides all services from provision to recycling from a single source.\nFurther information under: https://also.com\nJob description:\nAnalyzing and Optimization of business process within ALSO Group.\nConfiguration of SAP System (Customizing) for ALSO Processes.\nSubproject lead for international Rollouts.\nSupport and Customizing of Add-On‘s.\nGroupwide consulting of FI processes.\nCoordination of project teams for system changes and adaptions.\nLearning lessons for Key Users.\nCoordination of programming requests.\nWhat we are looking for:\nUniversity degree or equivalent qualification.\nMulti-year experience as SAP FI consultant.\nAccounting knowledge.\nAnalytical Skills.\nWillingness to travel (<10%).\nProfessional skills of spoken and written English and German.\nSAP S/4 HANA knowledge is an advantage.\nOur Benefits:\nVaried activities in an internationally oriented company with an informal culture.\nOffers for health promotion (e.g. digital sports courses).\nNeeds-oriented training and further education internally and externally.\nEmployee discounts and special conditions with various cooperation partners (e.g. e-bike leasing).\nAre you interested? Then send us your application documents, stating your salary requirements and earliest possible starting date here.\nIt is one of our fundamental values to respect human rights and to ensure that they are respected. This includes, in particular, respecting the personal dignity and privacy of each individual. Ethical behaviour is also expected of all our employees in business dealings with our partners. We are committed to fair, unrestricted competition and do not allow our decisions to be influenced by gifts or invitations, let alone financial benefits. Improving the lives of all people through technology - that is ALSO's goal. This also includes protecting our environment and making careful use of the limited resources we have. For further reference, please refer to our Code of Conduct.", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 41, 9, 729133), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
