{'job_title_name': '(NEW) Master Thesis in Consulting - Germany', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'FEV Consulting GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Fev-Europe?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad3f2kj4ri802&fromjk=cccdf649a18380e5', 'city': 'Aachen', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 15, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=cccdf649a18380e5&bb=Q7ROYPGOY2ftFfTtpF-qdPvlgnP-9eQ4tcojHdPCoPqWMcituYItZAoxPvjiTl9j&xkcb=SoDT67M3HqSG8rxgUR0IbzkdCdPP&fccid=c5e4d44efdaf77fe&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=140', 'job_description': "The importance of Circular Economy is ever increasing. There are frameworks in EU/US and other countries in place to support circular activities. Many, esp. suppliers need to know how to approach this topic and how to implement a circular economy strategy. First step could be a quick gap assessment as an entry point for consulting.\nYour tasks:\nResearch on existing approach\nFEV Consulting evaluation approach need to be developed and tested\nYou are completing your master's degree in industrial engineering, mechanical engineering, electrical engineering, computer science, business administration, economics or a comparable course of study at a leading university\nYou have exceptional academic performance and impress us with your personal profile\nYou ideally gained inital practical experience in consulting or a technical industry, favorable also with AI tools\nYou have very good analytical skills\nYou are a motivated and committed team player\nYou have very good knowledge of MS Office applications\nYou communicate very well in English, and you are ideally fluent in the local office language - both verbally and in writing\nAn affinity for coding completes your profile", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 41, 19, 938300), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
