{'job_title_name': 'Senior Process Engineer (m/f/d) - Anaerobic Digestion', 'job_type': 'Festanstellung', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Hitachi Zosen Inova', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Hitachi-Zosen-Inova-2?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad45apih1s803&fromjk=320d10954fc89ba0', 'city': '92421 Schwandorf in Bayern', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 8, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=320d10954fc89ba0&bb=REbZEDoxKpQuhqk7WzQBnLfrNsniCshX3eC4i4FLUNPlc7a-Zvvf29B4ElduhdIPRFrt9_aVui6JMm8JuXvZvHJ3UPtpNc7o4u_BCP0aVFs%3D&xkcb=SoBG67M3HqSBwP2Q8p0MbzkdCdPP&fccid=a38b3a227f54b13a&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=70', 'job_description': 'Company Description\nZurich-based green-tech company\nHitachi Zosen Inova (HZI)\nis a global leader in solutions for energy transition and circular economy including Energy from Waste (EfW) and Renewable Gas (RG), operating as part of the Hitachi Zosen Corporation Group.\nHZI acts as a project developer, technology supplier and engineering, procurement and construction (EPC) contractor delivering complete turnkey plants and system solutions for thermal and biological waste recovery. Its solutions are based on efficient and environmentally sound technologies, are thoroughly tested, and can be flexibly adapted to customer requirements.\nHZI’s Service Solutions Group combines its own research and development with comprehensive manufacturing and erection capabilities to provide support throughout a plant’s entire plant cycle. HZI works for customers ranging from established waste management companies to up-and-coming partners in new markets. Its innovative and reliable solutions have been part of more than 1,600 reference projects worldwide.\nJob Description\nCreating and working on the basic and detail engineering\nProcess responsibility for all technical issues in the project\nIndependent technical handling of projects\nDevelopment and participation of HAZOP analysis design and dimensioning of parts, fittings, components, pipelines and other aggregates\nDevelopment and control of piping and instrument flow diagrams (P&ID) and execution plans within the framework of preliminary and execution planning\nTechnical evaluation and comparison of subcontractor offers\nPreparation of project-specific documentation (manuals and CE documentation)\nCarrying out and supporting official inspections and safety tests on the construction site\nQualifications\nAt least 5 years of experience in comparable function in the energy, environmental technology, renewable energies or in similar industry\nStructured and diligent way of working\nReliability and sense of responsibility\nAbility to work in a team\nProven problem-solving skills, ability to consider complex multi-disciplinary aspects of problems\nCompetence and ability to take decisions within the frame defined by company processes\nGood knowledge of English, other languages an advantage\nAdditional Information\nResponsibility and challenge within multi discipline field of activities\nOpportunity to gain an insight into various technical disciplines\nCareer path options\nStart-up mentality within a company proud of its history\nTeam-oriented working atmosphere in an international company\nInclusive, values led culture\nFor HR agencies: Please note that we do not accept applications coming from agencies. Thank you.', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 41, 42, 640153), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
