{'job_title_name': 'ENVIRONMENTAL SPECIALIST (F/M/D) (w/m/d)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'G+E GETEC Holding GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/G-E-Getec-Holding-Gmbh?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad577s2gtd001&fromjk=3047020335c314a3', 'city': 'Deutschland', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 1, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=3047020335c314a3&bb=MSzRphRNzJEIFv98cQRXfCgG9H8ln3ZEpVXp1XtOTmF9aXd1Lo6gg4MWQTI6Vpdd8Nm2HMHqS_-33HOOF6LLcKr9GNsvlXKTsDB3ROqFko0%3D&xkcb=SoAH67M3HqSeG6WeNh0MbzkdCdPP&fccid=12910661fdbe5862&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=0', 'job_description': 'GERMANY\nFULL TIME\nUNLIMITED\nYOUR FUTURE TASKS\nExpert and international contact person on environmental issues\nFocus on building an environmental data excellence group-wide\nResponsible for and compilation of the Corporate Carbon Footprint (e-data collection and consolidation)\nFurther development of measurement methods for environmental indicators (GHG accounting, biodiversity, waste, water, etc.)\nDevelopment of the environmental and climate strategy\nSetup a due diligence systems for environmental topics\nDevelopment of partner solutions with regard to environmental controlling and analysis\nOperational support for innovative project developments with regard to environmental aspects\nSupport in the analysis of Environmental data and identification of risks, impacts and opportunities goup-wide\nYOU AS A PERSON\nDegree Environmental engineering/ environmental science or a comparable qualification is a must\nAt least 4-5 years of experience in this area in particular\nVery experienced in in GHG accounting, Corporate and Product carbon footprint\nGood knowledge about energy efficiency, biodiversity, circular economy, compensation methods, carbon capturing, Life Cycle Assessment (LCA)\nKnowledge of environment management systems is a plus\nFluent in English\nAnalytical working style\nProject management skills, well organized\nTeam player/networker, high communication skills\nIntercultural experience\nEntrepreneurial mindset and solution-driven mindset\nKnowledge in Office 365\nApply now\nENERGY FOR MORE\nWE OFFER MORE\nYou are an important part of an international growing company, which operates in a socially relevant area and actively promotes the energy transition\nWe offer you a good work-life balance through mobile working, flexible working hours and 30 days of vacation per year\nYou want to develop yourself further? We offer you a wide range of training and coaching opportunities\nIs the atmosphere important to you? - Agile working and modern office concepts are a matter of course for us\nWe offer our employees the job bike concept: keep fit 365 days a year and also protect the environment\nDon’t hesitate and APPLY NOW! The GETEC Recruiting Team is looking forward to receiving your application:\n+49 (0) 391 2568-379\nkarriere@getec.de\nWe warmly welcome applications that contribute to the diversity of our company.\nApply now', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 42, 17, 250280), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
