{'job_title_name': 'Battery Engineering Intern (M/F/D)', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'HagerEnergy GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Hagerenergy-Gmbh?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad5mk3k78q800&fromjk=a0d90f2a5b1a7089', 'city': 'Osnabrück', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 4, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=a0d90f2a5b1a7089&bb=tOl6p5RfcL17FyfXLz0c7eqwZrYxsSTDuY13Lue2R_PpVHvioejGZbLAn3aD3hTL&xkcb=SoAP67M3HqSebrQ8LR0JbzkdCdPP&fccid=aa63d2d23cae6cd3&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=30', 'job_description': 'We are pioneers\nE3/DC develops and produces intelligent “all-in-one” storage systems and electric vehicle charging solutions. All components, from inverter and energy management to batteries, are developed and integrated by us. This including end-to-end services and cloud-solutions. We are around 300 experts (and growing), working from several locations. Our recipe for success: creative freedom and responsibility in the projects, customer proximity and concentration on a common goal – to accelerate the energy transition. E3/DC is a brand of HagerEnergy GmbH and part of Hager Group, one of the leading providers of electrotechnical solutions.\nYou are actively working on the energy transition\nFor our headquarters in Osnabrück, we are looking for a Battery Engineering Intern (m/f/d) who is interested in topics related to battery systems and would like to support our Battery Business Team in further developing our battery monitoring, analytics and circular economy solutions.\nResponsibilities\nAdvance our battery monitoring, analytics, and circular economy solutions\nSupport implementation, and testing of algorithms to improve battery performance, reliability, and safety\nExtend implementation of battery algorithms to new and upcoming products\nImprove processing efficiency and reliability of our monitoring and analytics platform\nDevise visualization and analysis tools for our Support and Service teams\nCollaborate closely with our embedded and cloud-software developers to scale and automate our algorithms\nSupport ad-hoc topics and ongoing technical solutions\nRequirements\nStudying electrical engineering, computer science, informatics, or similar (over 2 years of Bachelor’s education required)\nGood knowledge of Python/MATLAB. C++ is an advantage.\nStructured and analytics work mode with high pragmatism and getting-things-done attitude\nAptitude for interdisciplinary work and willingness to dive into unknown topics\nGreat communicator in German and English\nTeam player and flexible\nWhat we offer\nINSPIRING: high decision-making and creative freedom, plenty of room for your own ideas and the common passion to make the world a better place\nRESPONSIBLE: being able to change things and make decisions, grow together with the company and shape the future\nGROWTH-ORIENTED: ongoing feedback and a wide range of training opportunities\nAUTHENTIC: a successful, financially strong premium brand in a future-proof market, customer proximity, start-up character\nCHERRIES ON TOP: flexible working hours, possibility of mobile working, e-charging, modern building, various discounts via the Corporate Benefits platform, experience our spirit at larger or smaller events\nE3/DC - Simply better\nWe focus on diversity and would like to invite all people with their individual backgrounds and personalities to apply. Do you have any questions about the vacancy? Please contact Elisa Jöhne via +49 541 760 268 0. We look forward to getting to know you.\nApply now!\nZurück zur Übersicht\nE3/DC gehört in Deutschland zu den TOP Marken für Lithium-Ionen-Speicher mit integrierter Erzeugung und liefert weitgehende Versorgungsunabhängigkeit.\nBestandteile & Funktionen\nWechselrichter\nNotstromfunktion\nHausautomation\nEnergiemanagement\nGarantie & Service\nEnergieportal\nRatgeber\nStromspeicher\nPhotovoltaikanlage\nElektromobilität\nAutarkie\nSolarthermie\nPartner – Vorteile & Services\nUnternehmen\nKarriere\nMediathek\nShowroom\nEvents\nNeues Portal\nAltes Portal\nInfocenter\nKonfigurator\nS10 SE\nHauskraftwerk für Einsteiger\nmehr erfahren\nS10 X\nDer Allrounder\nmehr erfahren\nS10 E PRO\nDas Profi-Hauskraftwerk\nmehr erfahren\nS20 X PRO\nMaximale Leistung, maximale Kapazität\nmehr erfahren\nWallbox\nGehen Sie mit uns auf die Überholspur\nmehr erfahren\n© Copyright 2023 by HagerEnergy GmbH\nKontakt\nImpressum\nDatenschutz\nBitte wählen Sie die Art Ihrer Anfrage\nAngebot anfordern\nRückruf vereinbaren\nInfomaterial anfordern\nZurück zur Übersicht', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 42, 33, 178462), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
