{'job_title_name': 'Marketing / Assistant', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'PAPACKS Sales GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Papacks-Sales-Gmbh?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhad5v0rk6rc801&fromjk=6bb586d7b1d22244', 'city': 'Köln', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 2, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=6bb586d7b1d22244&bb=5ZPnWC31O8Xekme-YSmbTo1jgqOlAroBhQBOMuBDm6r-cZfPLCd1wnxOAUm-bnVHgY4Ke5V-CGlcvTLMR03hiakEpQgT6E-fVdoTaZR6Ngw%3D&xkcb=SoAl67M3HqSebZw3lR0PbzkdCdPP&fccid=1e52236121d19d26&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circular%20Economy&l=Deutschland&filter=0&start=10', 'job_description': "COLOGNE\nFULL TIME\nM/F/D\nFROM NOW ON\nJoin our team as a dynamic assistant to the marketing management – your path to creative development and professional excellence\nYOUR FUTURE AREA OF RESPONSIBILITY WITH US\nSupport the Chief Marketing Officer (CMO), management and team in the conception, implementation and monitoring of marketing campaigns\nWrite various marketing materials, including reports, brochures, presentations and company information materials\nAssist in developing strategies and campaigns to increase brand visibility and business growth\nSupport with the company's social media activities\nComplete administrative tasks to ensure smooth daily operations\nCoordination with sales to ensure effective collaboration\nPlanning events, trade fairs and other promotional activities\nIndependently create compelling materials for award submissions and proactively identify new, appropriate awards.\nYOUR PROFILE\nCompleted training or studies in the field of economics (e.g. business administration, marketing, sales) or comparable qualifications. Students seeking practical experience are particularly welcome.\nIdeally, professional experience in marketing, sales or in the packaging or sustainability sectors\nQuick comprehension and high adaptability\nKnowledge of Adobe CC, Google Workspace and the Apple ecosystem\nIndependent working style with a creative and strategic way of thinking\nAnalytical skills to clearly present complex information\nExcellent written and oral communication skills\nOUR OFFER\nWe offer the opportunity to plan your working hours individually (flexitime).\nAn interesting and responsible job in a dynamic environment for a market of the future\nThorough training and the opportunity for personal and professional development\nWe welcome applications from candidates with diverse educational backgrounds and professional experiences who would like to bring their unique perspectives and skills to our team.\nAn attractive remuneration\nIf you are ready to grow in a creative and dynamic environment and take your career to the next level, we look forward to receiving your application!\nWE ARE LOOKING FORWARD TO YOUR APPLICATION!\nAll current job vacancies\nAll Offers\nAwards - Innovation and environmental awards - Certifications of PAPACKS®\nHome » Company » Jobs » Marketing / Assistenz\nPAPACKS SALES GmbH\nHeadquarters Germany\nVon-Hünefeld-Str. 1, 50829 Cologne, Germany\nPAPACKS is one of Europe's most innovative producers and packaging manufacturers for plastic-free and sustainable packaging solutions made from rapidly renewable raw materials to avoid single-use plastic. We use renewable raw materials for fiber forms, which can be combined with organic coatings developed by us and our coating technology to obtain the required barriers. These sustainable packaging solutions can be used in modern recycling concepts and offer a replacement for numerous plastic packaging.\nPAPACKS offers a unique product and solution portfolio that enables our customers to make the transition to sustainable packaging. This allows companies to take responsibility for their packaging. We have already saved more than 3.500.000 kg of single-use plastic and replaced it with natural raw materials.\nWe develop and produce sustainable packaging for the food, cosmetics, pharmaceutical and medical industries, as well as for product manufacturers in the technical non-food sector.\nCopyright by PAPACKS®Sales GmbH, All rights reserved.\nAnalysis\nXing\nTwitter\nFacebook f\nInstagram\nYoutube\nLegal Notice\nPrivacy policy\nterms and conditions\nChange privacy settings\nHistory of privacy settings\nRevoke consent\nCircular Economy\nProducts\nAll Products\nSustainable advent calendar\nTransport trays and load carriers\nFood packaging\nNacho bowl for cinema & events\nPAPACKS® IMG\nNatural CAPS\nRefill CAPS for cosmetics\nFiber bottle\n3D tools\nGreen Robotics\nFiber casting production\nCompany\nMission & Purpose, Locations, About us\nteam and contacts\nJobs / career\nNews\nContact", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 42, 41, 674350), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_1'}
