H & Co.KG | Burgweg 3 | 89601 Schelklingen-Ingstetten\nwww.lorenz-meters.de', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 44, 56, 497295), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_3'}
