{'job_title_name': 'Computer Vision Engineer', 'job_type': 'Festanstellung', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Digital Waffle', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Digital-Waffle?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhadgo96ipbk804&fromjk=b86a3c1ebc7186be', 'city': 'Berlin', 'remote': None, 'salary': '100.000 € pro Jahr', 'crawled_page_rank': 1, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=b86a3c1ebc7186be&bb=gn6iqSVem9CgYkU_Lbv2tLZjoGoV2Q09JrdeD1Nkh0BstIpJL7JMBB6d_nEDSfJDuiqSGFHR1-KgR4jYAWBCWTG3aV4UMPN_AkxaXQPRnnY%3D&xkcb=SoBI67M3HqR_lCw3lR0KbzkdCdPP&fccid=af02b98b92a2145b&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=0', 'job_description': 'Computer Vision Engineer\nJob details\nPosted 30 November 2023\nSalary €100000 per annum\nLocationBerlin\nJob type Permanent\nDiscipline Development\nReferencePN-40\nContact NamePoppy Nabbs\nJob description\nDigital Waffle is proud to have partnered with an innovative Start-Up in Berlin that focuses on how digitalisation can promote circularity and sustainability across the Globe\nI am looking for a Senior Computer Vision Engineer to join their Berlin office! If you are looking to join an innovative, market-leading Start-Up who is making a real difference to a better future... then this is the role for you! ✨\nJob: Senior Computer Vision Engineer\nLocation: Berlin, Germany (Hybrid)\nSalary: €100,000 (+ bonus)\nLanguage: English\nKey Skills:\nI am seeking a Computer Vision Engineer with a strong commitment to sustainability and a passion for developing innovative solutions that contribute to a more circular future.\n5 years of expertise in Computer Vision or Deep Learning engineering, preferably with a focus on industrial-grade application development.\nFluency in C/C++ and Python\nThorough knowledge of Computer Vision toolkits and frameworks like OpenCV, Tesseract, and Tensorflow\nExperience with big data analytics technologies like Spark and Hadoop is a plus, and proficiency in GPU/TPU computing using NVIDIA CUDA or cloud-based environments is desirable.\nThe ability to translate cutting-edge research into practical prototypes and solutions is paramount.\nFamiliarity with IoT sensors and applications, along with knowledge of cloud-based infrastructure, is a beneficial addition.\nEnglish speaking\nIf this sounds interesting, then please do apply directly or email me at poppy.nabbs@digitalwaffle.co ✨', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 48, 35, 765311), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
