{'job_title_name': 'IT Project Manager (all genders)', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'AllocNow GmbH', 'company_indeed_url': None, 'city': None, 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 5, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=7e1d2df0db996c73&bb=qvon_OPmy0MGrDJRLDpGR1WlQBNJd4suHfRIFDzosIVlS3xcBp1w8phbd0AoqSFu&xkcb=SoA167M3HqR_iA2Q5B0IbzkdCdPP&fccid=dd616958bd9ddc12&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=40', 'job_description': 'AllocNow is a pioneering cleantech company, focusing on the chemical and process industry. Our mission is to facilitate the sustainability transformation by providing a platform that enables effective management of the environmental impact of products at scale. The Product Sustainability Platform automates lifecycle assessments with unprecedented levels of consistency, efficiency, and reliability, supporting companies on their journey towards net zero and circularity.\nWe are growing and searching for motivated and versatile talents to strengthen our team. Get in touch if you like to work purposefully and make a difference!\nAufgaben\nAs IT Project Manager (all genders) you are responsible for overseeing and managing implementation projects at renowned global enterprise customers. You serve as an interface between our customers and our field engineering team, making a substantial contribution to the overall success of our projects.\nProject management: You plan and coordinate implementation projects and execute them leveraging both traditional and agile project management methods as needed.\nBudget responsibility: You hold the reins on budget responsibility, working closely with the account lead and technical leads to ensure that projects are financially sound.\nStakeholder management: You steer heterogeneous project teams, moderate committees and boards, including those at management level, and present complex issues in a way that is appropriate for the target group.\nRequirements Management: You diligently assess and evaluate requirements, considering customer benefits, alignment with our product strategy, adherence to IT architecture, and compliance specifications.\nFurther development: You are dedicated to establishing and perpetually optimizing and standardizing our project execution methods, fostering an environment of growth and excellence.\nQualifikation\nDegree in (business) engineering or informatics, business administration or a comparable qualification\nInitial professional experience in traditional and agile IT project management, with a strong focus on serving large corporate clients\nExcellent methodological skills and a broad spectrum of (agile) tools as well as strong moderation, communication and presentation skills on all levels\nHands-on and service mentality, conflict resolution skills, as well as diligent working style, personal responsibility and resilience\nConceptual and analytical strength\nCustomer-centric mindset, with a primary focus on delivering exceptional customer experiences\nEnthusiastic commitment to sustainability-related issues\nExceptional proficiency in written and spoken German as well as English\nBenefits\nAlmost unlimited growth opportunities\nExposure to renowned clients and relevant business problems\nCompetitive compensation and benefits package\nWork mode\nTo enable our remote work mode, we work with:\nMS Teams for synchronous communication\nGitLab for project management\nDaily project standup meetings, bi-weekly company meetings\nBi-monthly face-to-face meetings of our team\nEqual Opportunities for Everyone\nWe are open to all groups of people without regard to age, color, national origin, race, religion, gender, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or expression, marital status, or any other legally protected characteristics.\nOur Mission\nThere is no planet B. Humans must reduce greenhouse gas emissions. We take action together with our clients in the chemical sector which by itself contributes up to 40% of global industrial GHG emissions. Join us on our mission to lead the way to a zero-carbon economy and boost innovation to make chemical companies climate neutral.\nOur solution is\nIndustry-specific: Handling the complexity of chemical value chains is our daily business\nBusiness-focused: We make sustainability data available to a broad range of users and empower them to take action\nData-driven: We offer a fast and cost-effective calculation of sustainability metrics\nAre you keen on joining our team, building a great product, and growing with us? Get in touch!', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 48, 36, 388912), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
