{'job_title_name': 'Working Student (f/m/d) Market Intelligence for Consumer Goods', 'job_type': '', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Siegwerk Druckfarben AG & Co. KGaA', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Siegwerk?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhadgp43k2le801&fromjk=5121c400cec8f029', 'city': '53721 Siegburg', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 1, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=5121c400cec8f029&bb=gn6iqSVem9CgYkU_Lbv2tH_0K30sf989EA3n0TAh07PEqh-Z7i6GgRvEh63e-YIE6qWY8aB2CxUTquj8v0xw-FGy5d_yHQNeZxtVvKb6cwI%3D&xkcb=SoD867M3HqR_lCw3lR0LbzkdCdPP&fccid=b7c78c2beb3c4e57&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=0', 'job_description': 'Siegwerk is one of the world’s leading suppliers of Printing Inks and sustainable packaging solutions. A career here will give you significant flexibility and support in a company focused on making a positive impact in the world. Siegwerk is poised to disrupt the global packaging industry; changing the way packaging is produced and consumed for the benefit of us all. At Siegwerk, you will have everything you need to help make that change.\nJoin us, let’s Do it. With Heart.\nApply now!\nOur benefits - What we offer You:\nFlexible working hours and remote work (up to 60%)\nAttractive remuneration (€15 to €17 gross per hour, depending on qualification)\nGood traffic connections (job ticket available), city center location with restaurants and stores as well as an in-house canteen\nAccess to the global learning platform “Siegwerk Learning Hub” with more than 20,000 online learning modules accessible worldwide as well as online language training with Speexx\nExternal employee consulting ICAS, which supports you with professional and private questions\nYour Tasks - What You can expect as Working Student (f/m/d) Market Intelligence for Consumer Goods?\nYou create Market Intelligence on Consumer Goods and Industry Supplies to generate focus areas for Circularity solutions for Packaging.\nYou collate, cluster and analyze data (Brands/ Revenue/ Sustainability pledges/ Innovation launches) for Mass Market Consumer Goods, Airlines (Food & Beverage supplies) as well as Aspirational Brands for Sustainability.\nYou identify key contacts within companies of these sectors.\nYour Profile - What do You bring as Working Student (f/m/d) Market Intelligence for Consumer Goods?\nYou are an enrolled student in (Business) Informatics, Data Science, Business Administration or a closely related field.\nYou are highly motivated and provide a can-do mentality.\nYou are solutions focused with a creative spirit.\nYou have good interpersonal skills.\nYou have strong communication skills in English.\nExperiences with Microsoft Dynamics Power Apps, Chat GPT as well as Data Science would be an advantage.\nAre you interested?\nShould you have any further questions, Sarah Inger looks forward to your call! You can reach her via phone 02241 304 107 as well as via Xing or LinkedIn.\nJob ID:\n25329\nPlease use our online platform to apply for this position. Job applications via mail or e-mail can not be accepted due to data security.\nFor marketing purposes different job titles are mentioned here whereby the job ad title is relevant.', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 48, 36, 480456), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
