{'job_title_name': 'Strategic Account Manager - Embelex (m/f/d)', 'job_type': 'Festanstellung', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Avery Dennison', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Avery-Dennison?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhadgqqdk78q800&fromjk=22c56d0c221e7323', 'city': '91052 Erlangen', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 5, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=22c56d0c221e7323&bb=J36KhxfwfwGF7aXaa65rJq9fbgIDH9_MuDcmb9xZXGaVBBd1OfT-FyJ49yPh_Kmd&xkcb=SoBK67M3HqR_iAWQ5B0ObzkdCdPP&fccid=c404ee662148c290&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=40', 'job_description': 'Company Description\nAvery Dennison Corporation (NYSE: AVY)\nis a global materials science and digital identification solutions company that provides branding and information labeling solutions, including pressure-sensitive materials, radio-frequency identification (RFID) inlays and tags, and a variety of converted products and solutions. The company designs and manufactures a wide range of labeling and functional materials that enhance branded packaging, carry or display information that connects the physical and the digital, and improve customers’ product performance. The company serves an array of industries worldwide, including home and personal care, apparel, e-commerce, logistics, food and grocery, pharmaceuticals and automotive. The company employs approximately 36,000 employees in more than 50 countries. Reported sales in 2022 were $9.0 billion. Learn more at www.averydennison.com.\nPlease let us know if we can support you with reasonable accommodations throughout the application process by contacting our Talent Acquisition team via\njobs@eu.averydennison.com\n.\nJob Description\nFor our team in Erlangen (Germany), we are searching for a\nStrategic Account Manager - Embelex (m/f/d)\n. This is a challenging role in a very fast, highly competitive changing business and within a high-performing sales team.\nAs a Strategic Account Manager (m/f/d) you identify, evaluate, and manage new business opportunities and market initiatives for one of our Key customers.\nActivities may include, but are not limited to the following:\nIdentify, assess, develop, and manage new programs and new business opportunities; leading to successful commercialization efforts. Work with our key customers to identify unmet needs, and implement initiatives to meet those needs.\nResponsible for profitably growing the business.\nContribute to the continuous improvement of reporting processes for the sales organization\nProvide support to Sales Teams for customer data analysis, rebate analysis, new program ROI analysis, Sales Forecast, e.g. Design ad hoc reports based on available data / Metrics to support sales initiatives.\nProvide support for Sales Target formulation and review. In charge of the Sales Target Achievement measurement process ( SIP ) and managing the relevant inquiry.\nSupport ad hoc projects on reviewing, understanding the systems, and providing input to improve the systems so that more detailed analysis at the program level can be done for Sales Teams.\nQualifications\nWhat we expect from you! - Your Expertise:\n4+ years of business development, sales, product management, marketing, or other directly related experience\nKnowledgeable on HTL, Woven, and Smart Embellishments is a plus\nProficient in assessing customer needs\nNegotiation skills/experience\nAffinity for sustainability and digitization in the context of data cloud, circularity, etc.\nStrong financial skills and business acumen\nKnowledgeable in conducting market and territory analysis and planning\nAbility to present data in a logical concise manner\nSkilled in project/process management and meeting facilitation\nAbility to work within a highly matrix organization with a multicultural environment and diverse workforce\nAdvanced knowledge of MS Office and Google Apps\nLanguages: German (business fluent), English (business fluent)\nAdditional Information\nWho we are! - Our Story:\nEach of us, Every day! Eight Values. One Team!\nWe understand diversity and equal opportunities as enrichment for our future-oriented work at Avery Dennison. With us, teams are balanced and diverse. Because each of us is unique, and we appreciate bringing together different personalities and talents.\nAvery Dennison is an equal-opportunity employer. You are interested in knowing more about our Diversity & Inclusion approach? Please go to averydennison.com/en/home/about-us/diversity-and-inclusion.html\nAt Avery Dennison, we do what we love, and we love what we do - Just click here, and get us to know even better: Life @ Avery Dennison (linkedin.com/company/avery-dennison/life/emea)', 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 48, 49, 484556), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
