{'job_title_name': '(Junior) Marketing Automation Specialist (m/f/x)', 'job_type': 'Vollzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'rebuy', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Rebuy-4?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhadh805k78s800&fromjk=722f49643377dbaa', 'city': None, 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 5, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=722f49643377dbaa&bb=X_-SYUK5wyfKb7vY_OSHzrNqmniHjMMsVGqM57eMexUhnapd5eUGw3iScZJQgiDP&xkcb=SoBK67M3HqR_iB2Q5B0JbzkdCdPP&fccid=ff7fa90cb7b1e843&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=40', 'job_description': "Ready to become part of the most important mission on this planet? We are rebuy, pioneers in the sustainable reuse of electronics and media. and we are looking for you! Our mission: to make circular living accessible to all, one transaction at a time. By giving products a second chance, we reduce resource consumption and avoid unnecessary e-waste.\nOur team of 600 comes from all corners of the world; we drive things forward collaboratively, take personal responsibility, value positive critical thinking, and persistently serve our customers and the planet.\nWe are seeking a goal-oriented individual with a background in computer science or a related field who is keen on diving into the world of performance marketing. The ideal candidate will combine their technical know-how with a burgeoning passion for marketing, to drive automation and efficiency across our campaigns and processes. This role is an excellent opportunity for someone who wishes to leverage their technical skills in the fast-paced world of re-commerce and digital marketing.\nKey Responsibilities:\nCollaborate with the Marketing Technology Manager to design, develop, and implement automated marketing campaigns.\nDevelop and implement scripts and tools to optimize routine Google Ads tasks such as reporting, budget pacing, and campaign restructures.\nAssist in creating dashboards and visualization tools to help the team access data in real-time and make data-driven decisions.\nResearch and recommend new automation tools and technologies to enhance the department's capabilities.\nStay updated with the latest trends in marketing technology and automation, ensuring that our company remains at the forefront of innovation.\nTrain and support other team members in the use of automated tools and processes.\nRegularly review the efficiency of existing tools and scripts, refining and tweaking as necessary.\nBachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.\nFamiliarity with digital marketing platforms, particularly Google Ads, is a plus\nStrong coding and scripting skills, preferably in Python or JavaScript.\nGood understanding of databases and SQL.\nAbility to communicate technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.\nStrong problem-solving skills and analytical thinking.\nA keen interest in digital marketing and a willingness to learn.\nLocation:\nBerlin\nHO\nHybrid - can work remotely in Germany\nPurpose, a great company culture and awesome benefits - what to expect at rebuy:\nWork with a friendly team that is passionate about circularity and wants to make the world a little more sustainable, one transaction at a time.\nFeel comfortable in an environment where independence and new ideas are welcome.\nBenefit from flat hierarchies and the greatest possible transparency so that things don't take longer than they have to and you always feel well informed.\nEnjoy our centrally located office in Berlin (Erkelenzdamm 11 - 13, 10999 Berlin).\nBenefit from our family-friendly, flexible environment and paid child sick leave.\nBring your dog to the office: we love animals and want to cuddle yours, too!\nUse employee discounts on rebuy.de, sustainable products at Futurebens, offers for sustainable micro-mobility and massages directly in our office.\nDesign your own benefits mix on our benefits portal worth EUR 50 net per month.\nHave fun at our legendary team and company events.\nUse our mental health offers as part of a cooperation with the Fürstenberg Institute.\nTake care of your work-life balance with 30 vacation days.\nAt rebuy all people are welcome and supported! We would like to talk, regardless of age, disability, national and social origin, skin color, religion, gender identity and sexual orientation. Just be who you are!", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 48, 54, 552821), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
