{'job_title_name': 'Full Stack Developer (m/f/x)', 'job_type': 'Teilzeit', 'shift_and_schedule': '', 'company_name': 'Reclay Group', 'company_indeed_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Reclay-Group?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1hhadhegq2cj4000&fromjk=df4e15c8cb8ee532', 'city': 'Köln', 'remote': None, 'salary': None, 'crawled_page_rank': 2, 'job_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=df4e15c8cb8ee532&bb=jcvgBJC2Fgw_f0h9z4_KE9VR1AesM-GTNv8V8Yg4Wkd-z1um-o6tWa4v9lV-tzhx9uSLhmzHFZrhvssb2jnwXiYbhyzyZoeHRobYGrBpgcE%3D&xkcb=SoCS67M3HqTKTv2Q6Z0LbzkdCdPP&fccid=029b5163ecc33ecc&vjs=3', 'listing_page_url': 'https://de.indeed.com/jobs?q=Circularity&l=Deutschland&filter=0&vjk=17f1151bb19093cb&start=10', 'job_description': "Job at RAAN Family / SynoptiCons Digital Circular Economy Experts:\nWho are we?\nAt SynoptiCons we create Digital Solutions to propel sustainability together with industries and consumers in the global Circular Economy. We offer a suite of products to optimize the circularity of materials, fulfil environmental objectives and increase consumer engagement with recycling. We operate throughout Europe with offices in Germany, Spain and Austria.\nWe are currently looking for a Full Stack Developer (m/f/x) to produce scalable software solutions.\nYou will be part of a cross-functional team responsible for the full software development lifecycle, from conception to deployment. We need your support in the development of an online platform for customers who are looking for guidance and assistance in handling their EPR obligations in Europe. You will work closely with our inhouse designers, marketing and data specialists\nFull Stack Developer (m/f/x)\nWhat’s the job about?\nAs a Full Stack Developer, you:\nlove to create\ngreat software that generates value and delights users, not least through its visual design.\nlove to design, create, operate and maintain\nAWS components for our services and databases\ncollaborate\nwith your peers in development and product management to ideate and optimize software solutions.\ndesign and implement\neffective and scalable client-side and server-side architecture for well-functioning databases, applications and APIs.\ntake responsibility\nfor testing the software you create, to ensure it abides by our quality standard for responsiveness and efficiency.\ndare to experiment\nand seek to exchange with your teammates about ideas and new trends in business and technology.\nWhat should you bring to work?\nCommunication skills\nand a good command of the German and English language, to keep information flowing with your fellow teammates and our international clients\nCuriosity and courage\nexploring new ways in a dynamic environment to design and build desktop applications.\nKnowledge\nof multiple back-end languages and libraries (e.g. PHP, Java, Flutter, TypeScript (React, Vue, React Native)) and familiarity with common technology stacks.\nProven experience\nof minimum 3 years in software development, with experience in full stack development and microservice based software solutions for the AWS cloud being a plus.\nThe mindset to see\nfailures as opportunities\nto learn and grow as a team and personally.\nCommitment and attitude\nas a team player who understands that leadership is required of everyone.\nIndependent work style\n, thriving in a multi-location hybrid work setting.\nYour Benefits\nFlexible\nworking hours in full or part time\nTop-notch equipment\n, also for private use\nRegular team events and\ncelebrations\nWork from\nanywhere,\nmultiple times per year\nLearning and personal\ndevelopment budget\nWork in an amazing\ninternational\nteam\nRemote-first\nhybrid work setup, up to 100% remote\nCredits\nfor sustainable and public transport\nSmall print, but big for us.\nIt's not that we wouldn't care about it. But neither your nationality nor your religion or beliefs, neither your gender and gender identity nor your sex life, neither the colour of your skin nor your age, neither your family or parental status nor your medical status will make any difference in our hiring process. We propel diversity and inclusion, so come as you are.\nAll our employment decisions are based on the needs of our business, the requirements of the job and individual qualifications of people. Rest assured that we are committed to providing a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.\nYour Application\nWe are looking forward to reading about your CV, salary expectations and availability.", 'crawled_timestamp': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 10, 18, 48, 57, 943473), 'crawler_name': 'crawler_2'}
